MODULE: NoDrainPastHeadInclusiveHead
TARGET: NoDrainPastHead
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: consume the exclusive next sequence as an entry
PERTURBS: ReplayRead

--- FIND
    /\ applied' = Min(Head - 1, applied + ReplayBatch)
--- REPLACE
    /\ applied' = Min(Head, applied + ReplayBatch + 1) \* MUTATION: exclusive head consumed.
--- END
